WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.517
Kip shook the snow off his head.

2
00:00:03.518 --> 00:00:10.293
"Who threw that snowball?" he asked.

3
00:00:10.294 --> 00:00:12.024
Bird looked up.

4
00:00:12.025 --> 00:00:15.222
Snowy branches were above Kip.

5
00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:19.436
"Nobody threw a snowball, Kip," said Bird.

6
00:00:19.437 --> 00:00:23.262
Kip wasn't listening.

7
00:00:23.263 --> 00:00:25.814
He looked around.

8
00:00:25.815 --> 00:00:30.291
"Maybe Frog threw it," said Kip.

9
00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:34.273
"Frog is asleep for the winter," said Bird.

10
00:00:34.274 --> 00:00:38.406
"The snow came from—"

11
00:00:38.407 --> 00:00:41.237
"It was Squirrel!" said Kip.

12
00:00:41.238 --> 00:00:43.666
"I think he's awake."

13
00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:46.582
Bird sighed.

14
00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:49.776
"We need a snow fort," said Kip.

15
00:00:49.777 --> 00:00:52.682
"Then we'll be safe."

16
00:00:52.683 --> 00:00:56.193
Kip made a wall out of snow.

17
00:00:56.194 --> 00:01:05.676
"We don't need a snow fort," said Bird.

18
00:01:05.677 --> 00:01:18.789
Kip kept working.

19
00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:24.215
Soon Kip's snow fort was finished.

20
00:01:24.216 --> 00:01:27.234
Squirrel walked over.

21
00:01:27.235 --> 00:01:29.168
"Hi, Kip."

22
00:01:29.169 --> 00:01:31.298
Kip frowned at Squirrel.

23
00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:35.408
"Did you throw a snowball at me?" he asked.

24
00:01:35.409 --> 00:01:39.680
"No, why?" asked Squirrel.

25
00:01:39.681 --> 00:01:45.048
A strong wind blew.

26
00:01:45.049 --> 00:01:47.791
Snow fell on Kip and Squirrel.

27
00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:52.240
"Someone threw a snowball!" they both cried.

